["<aside class=\"callout why\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>A new scope is not aimed until you shoot it. A shotgun is not understood until you see its pattern.</p></aside>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sighting in plan in 4 steps: 1 bore sight, 2 get on paper at 25 metres, 3 set the real zero at 100 metres with 3 shot groups, 4 practise from field positions. Use the same load you hunt with.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sighting in: the plan</text>\n  <g font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <rect x=\"14\" y=\"50\" width=\"176\" height=\"96\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"44\" cy=\"80\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#fff\">1</text>\n    <text x=\"118\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Bore sight</text><text x=\"102\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">look down the barrel</text>\n    <rect x=\"210\" y=\"50\" width=\"176\" height=\"96\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"80\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#fff\">2</text>\n    <text x=\"316\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">25 m</text><text x=\"298\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">get on paper</text>\n    <rect x=\"14\" y=\"160\" width=\"176\" height=\"96\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"44\" cy=\"190\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"196\" fill=\"#fff\">3</text>\n    <text x=\"118\" y=\"196\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">100 m (109 yd)</text><text x=\"102\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">real zero, 3 shot groups</text>\n    <rect x=\"210\" y=\"160\" width=\"176\" height=\"96\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"190\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"196\" fill=\"#fff\">4</text>\n    <text x=\"316\" y=\"196\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Field</text><text x=\"298\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">sitting, sticks</text>\n  </g>\n  <g stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M190 98 h18 m-8 -6 l8 6 l-8 6\"/><path d=\"M298 146 Q 200 160 110 158 m8 -8 l-8 8 l8 6\"/><path d=\"M190 208 h18 m-8 -6 l8 6 l-8 6\"/></g>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Same load you will hunt with</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li><strong>3 shot groups</strong> from a solid rest. Adjust from the group centre <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Same load you hunt with. Different bullets hit different spots <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: full plan and what to bring</summary><ul><li>Rifle: <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Bore sight\">Bore sight</button>, then 25 m to get on paper, then 100 m (109 yd) for the real <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Zero\">Zero</button> (Tip).</li><li>Shoot <strong>3 shot groups</strong> from a solid rest. Adjust from the centre of the group, not one shot <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Use the <strong>same load</strong> you will hunt with. Different bullets hit different spots <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Shotgun: <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Patterning\">Patterning</button> at 37 m (40 yd) on a 76 cm (30 in) circle <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Bring: ammo, targets, stapler, rest or bags, ear and eye protection, tools for the turrets (Tip).</li><li>Let the barrel cool between groups. A hot barrel can shift shots (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"steps\" data-n=\"3\"><div class=\"steps-head\"><b>Bore sight in 3 steps</b><span class=\"steps-count\">1 of 3</span></div><div class=\"steps-track\"><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Bore sight step 1: the rifle sits solid in sandbags, bolt out, aimed at a target 25 metres away.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Solid rest, bolt out</text>\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"210\" width=\"400\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\"/>\n  <ellipse cx=\"70\" cy=\"200\" rx=\"34\" ry=\"16\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><ellipse cx=\"190\" cy=\"196\" rx=\"30\" ry=\"14\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/>\n  <path d=\"M30 168 L100 160 L108 160 L116 184 L200 182 L200 190 L110 194 L94 204 L84 198 L30 210 Z\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"100\" y=\"152\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#6b6f68\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"115\" y=\"154\" width=\"28\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <rect x=\"160\" y=\"156\" width=\"120\" height=\"7\" fill=\"#6b6f68\"/>\n  <rect x=\"104\" y=\"134\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <!-- target far -->\n  <rect x=\"330\" y=\"110\" width=\"50\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"355\" cy=\"140\" r=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"355\" cy=\"140\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <rect x=\"352\" y=\"170\" width=\"6\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/>\n  <line x1=\"290\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"335\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25 m</text>\n  <text x=\"130\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sandbags</text>\n  <text x=\"130\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Bolt out</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>1.</b> Prove it unloaded. Bolt out. Solid rest, target at 25 m.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Bore sight step 2: look through the bore from the back. Move the rifle until the target sits in the centre of the round bore view.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Look through the bore</text>\n  <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"155\" r=\"110\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"155\" r=\"70\" fill=\"#4a4f48\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"155\" r=\"44\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"155\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"155\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Target centred in the bore</text>\n  <text x=\"330\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Barrel</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>2.</b> Look through the bore. Centre the target.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animation, bore sight step 3: without moving the rifle, look through the scope. The crosshair starts off the target. Turning the turrets moves the crosshair onto the same spot you saw through the bore.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Now the scope: turn the turrets</text>\n  <clipPath id=\"gr-bore-align-c\"><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"160\" r=\"104\"/></clipPath>\n  <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"160\" r=\"104\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"160\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"160\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <g clip-path=\"url(#gr-bore-align-c)\"><g>\n    <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"60 -46;60 -46;60 0;0 0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.2;0.55;1\" dur=\"5s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <g stroke=\"#2f3a2b\"><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"160\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><line x1=\"230\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"160\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"160\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"130\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"280\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"190\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></g>\n  </g></g>\n  <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"160\" r=\"104\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n  <g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1;1;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.1;0.9;1\" begin=\"1s\" dur=\"1.8s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Down</text></g>\n  <g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1;1;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.1;0.9;1\" begin=\"2.8s\" dur=\"2s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Left</text></g>\n  <g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"5s\" dur=\".4s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <rect x=\"120\" y=\"270\" width=\"160\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Same spot ✓</text></g>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>3.</b> Rifle still. Turn turrets onto the same spot.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"steps-nav\"><button class=\"steps-prev\" aria-label=\"Back\">‹ Back</button><span class=\"steps-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><button class=\"steps-next\" aria-label=\"Next\">Next ›</button></div></div><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the full steps</summary><ol><li>Prove the rifle unloaded. Bolt out (<button class=\"term\" data-term=\"ACTS\">ACTS</button>).</li><li>Set the rifle solid in a rest or sandbags, target at 25 m.</li><li>Look <strong>through the bore</strong> from the back. Move the rifle until the target is centred in the bore <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Without moving the rifle, look through the scope.</li><li>Turn the turrets until the crosshair sits on the same spot <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>A shop laser bore sighter does the same job. It still is not a zero (Tip).</li></ol></details><a class=\"yt-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZUV40AetF5M\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"yt-play\">▶</span><span class=\"yt-text\"><b>How to Sight in a Rifle Scope Presented by Larry Potterfield | MidwayUSA Gunsmithing</b><small>Bore sight first, then fine tune at 100 m.<br>MidwayUSA, YouTube, 4 min. Needs internet.</small></span></a>","<div class=\"steps\" data-n=\"4\"><div class=\"steps-head\"><b>Zero in 4 steps</b><span class=\"steps-count\">1 of 4</span></div><div class=\"steps-track\"><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"At 25 metres: fire 1 shot, then a 3 shot group. Get the group centred left and right. It can sit a little off up and down for now.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25 m: get on paper</text>\n  <rect x=\"100\" y=\"40\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"140\" r=\"60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"140\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"140\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><circle cx=\"196\" cy=\"168\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"206\" cy=\"174\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"162\" r=\"5\"/></g>\n  <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Centred left and right ✓</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"288\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">At 25 m you need 4 times the clicks</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>1.</b> 25 m: centre the group left and right.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Target at 100 metres on a 1 centimetre grid. The centre of a 3 shot group sits 6 centimetres low and 3 centimetres left of the bullseye. With a quarter MOA scope, 1 click is about 0.73 centimetres. So turn 8 clicks UP and 4 clicks RIGHT.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"250\" height=\"280\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <g stroke=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n    <path d=\"M30 10 V290 M50 10 V290 M70 10 V290 M90 10 V290 M110 10 V290 M130 10 V290 M150 10 V290 M170 10 V290 M190 10 V290 M210 10 V290 M230 10 V290 M250 10 V290\"/>\n    <path d=\"M10 30 H260 M10 50 H260 M10 70 H260 M10 90 H260 M10 110 H260 M10 130 H260 M10 150 H260 M10 170 H260 M10 190 H260 M10 210 H260 M10 230 H260 M10 250 H260 M10 270 H260\"/>\n  </g>\n  <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"90\" r=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"90\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"206\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"216\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/></g>\n  <path d=\"M84 210 l12 0 M90 204 l0 12\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <g stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\">\n    <path d=\"M90 196 V96\"/><path d=\"M82 106 l8 -10 l8 10\"/>\n    <path d=\"M94 90 H140\"/><path d=\"M130 82 l10 8 l-10 8\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\"><text x=\"22\" y=\"160\">6 cm</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"112\">3 cm</text></g>\n  <text x=\"135\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1 square = 1 cm at 100 m</text>\n  <g font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">\n    <text x=\"272\" y=\"36\">1 click</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"56\" fill=\"#e8590c\">= 0.73 cm</text>\n    <text x=\"272\" y=\"100\">6 ÷ 0.73</text><rect x=\"270\" y=\"108\" width=\"120\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"129\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8 clicks UP</text>\n    <text x=\"272\" y=\"176\">3 ÷ 0.73</text><rect x=\"270\" y=\"184\" width=\"120\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"205\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4 clicks R</text>\n    <text x=\"272\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\">Move the bullet</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\">the way the</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\">arrow says</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>2.</b> 100 m: measure from the group centre to the bull.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animation: three shots land low and left at 100 metres. The group centre is marked. You turn 8 clicks up and 4 clicks right. The next 3 shot group lands on the bullseye. Zeroed.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <rect x=\"70\" y=\"10\" width=\"260\" height=\"250\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"110\" r=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"110\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <g fill=\"#2f3a2b\">\n    <circle cx=\"134\" cy=\"226\" r=\"6\" opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\".5s\" fill=\"freeze\"/></circle>\n    <circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"236\" r=\"6\" opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"1s\" fill=\"freeze\"/></circle>\n    <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"214\" r=\"6\" opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"1.5s\" fill=\"freeze\"/></circle>\n  </g>\n  <g opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"2s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <path d=\"M132 226 h16 M140 218 v16\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n    <path d=\"M140 210 V116 M132 126 l8 -10 l8 10 M146 110 H186 M176 102 l10 8 l-10 8\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"2.6s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <rect x=\"70\" y=\"266\" width=\"260\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"287\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8 clicks UP, 4 clicks R</text>\n  </g>\n  <g fill=\"#4a7fb0\" opacity=\"0\">\n    <set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"4s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"-60 116;0 0\" begin=\"4s\" dur=\"1.5s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"194\" cy=\"110\" r=\"6\"/><circle cx=\"206\" cy=\"120\" r=\"6\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"98\" r=\"6\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g opacity=\"0\"><set attributeName=\"opacity\" to=\"1\" begin=\"6s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <rect x=\"250\" y=\"20\" width=\"76\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"288\" y=\"41\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Zeroed</text>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">100 m</text>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">1st</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"74\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">2nd</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"114\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>3.</b> Turn the clicks. Shoot again to confirm.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Once zeroed, shoot from sitting with shooting sticks, the way you will shoot a deer. Confirm with a fresh 3 shot group.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Then shoot like you hunt</text>\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"240\" width=\"400\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\"/>\n  <g stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\">\n    <line x1=\"210\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"140\"/><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"140\"/>\n  </g>\n  <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"126\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <path d=\"M140 142 L130 200 L176 210 L196 240\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/>\n  <path d=\"M136 156 L200 150 L250 142\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/>\n  <path d=\"M110 152 L160 146 L340 128\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <rect x=\"150\" y=\"134\" width=\"60\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <text x=\"300\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Sticks</text>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Sitting</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Know your hit range from here (Tip)</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>4.</b> Then shoot from sitting with sticks.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"steps-nav\"><button class=\"steps-prev\" aria-label=\"Back\">‹ Back</button><span class=\"steps-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><button class=\"steps-next\" aria-label=\"Next\">Next ›</button></div></div><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the full steps</summary><ul><li>At 25 m: fire 1 shot, check, then a 3 shot group. Get it centred left and right (Tip).</li><li>Move to 100 m (109 yd). Fire a 3 shot group at the bullseye.</li><li>Find the centre of the group. Measure how far it is from the bullseye, in cm.</li><li>Turn the turrets the right number of clicks (next screen).</li><li>Fire another 3 shot group to confirm. Repeat until centred.</li><li>Then shoot from sitting and kneeling with sticks. That is how you will shoot a deer (Tip).</li></ul></details><a class=\"yt-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WGUqAugLIys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"yt-play\">▶</span><span class=\"yt-text\"><b>How to Zero a Riflescope in 3 Shots or Less</b><small>Zero your scope in three shots with a solid rest.<br>Vortex Optics, YouTube, 3 min. Needs internet.</small></span></a>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Target at 100 metres on a 1 centimetre grid. The centre of a 3 shot group sits 6 centimetres low and 3 centimetres left of the bullseye. With a quarter MOA scope, 1 click is about 0.73 centimetres. So turn 8 clicks UP and 4 clicks RIGHT.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"250\" height=\"280\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <g stroke=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n    <path d=\"M30 10 V290 M50 10 V290 M70 10 V290 M90 10 V290 M110 10 V290 M130 10 V290 M150 10 V290 M170 10 V290 M190 10 V290 M210 10 V290 M230 10 V290 M250 10 V290\"/>\n    <path d=\"M10 30 H260 M10 50 H260 M10 70 H260 M10 90 H260 M10 110 H260 M10 130 H260 M10 150 H260 M10 170 H260 M10 190 H260 M10 210 H260 M10 230 H260 M10 250 H260 M10 270 H260\"/>\n  </g>\n  <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"90\" r=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"90\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"206\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"216\" r=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"194\" r=\"5\"/></g>\n  <path d=\"M84 210 l12 0 M90 204 l0 12\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <g stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\">\n    <path d=\"M90 196 V96\"/><path d=\"M82 106 l8 -10 l8 10\"/>\n    <path d=\"M94 90 H140\"/><path d=\"M130 82 l10 8 l-10 8\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\"><text x=\"22\" y=\"160\">6 cm</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"112\">3 cm</text></g>\n  <text x=\"135\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1 square = 1 cm at 100 m</text>\n  <g font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">\n    <text x=\"272\" y=\"36\">1 click</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"56\" fill=\"#e8590c\">= 0.73 cm</text>\n    <text x=\"272\" y=\"100\">6 ÷ 0.73</text><rect x=\"270\" y=\"108\" width=\"120\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"129\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8 clicks UP</text>\n    <text x=\"272\" y=\"176\">3 ÷ 0.73</text><rect x=\"270\" y=\"184\" width=\"120\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"205\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4 clicks R</text>\n    <text x=\"272\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\">Move the bullet</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\">the way the</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\">arrow says</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Clicks = cm off ÷ 0.73, at 100 m <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>. Check the turret cap says 1/4 MOA (minute of angle) <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: MOA, yards, 25 m and MRAD</summary><ul><li>MOA is a tiny angle: about <strong>2.9 cm at 100 m</strong> <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li><li>Most hunting scopes move <strong>1/4 MOA per click</strong> <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>. Check the turret cap.</li><li>So 1 click moves the shot about <strong>0.73 cm at 100 m</strong> <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.<ul><li>At 100 yd (91 m): about 0.66 cm per click <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li><li>At 25 m: about 0.18 cm per click. You need 4 times the clicks <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li></ul></li><li>Example: group is 6 cm low and 3 cm left at 100 m.<ul><li>Up: 6 ÷ 0.73 = about <strong>8 clicks</strong> \"UP\".</li><li>Right: 3 ÷ 0.73 = about <strong>4 clicks</strong> \"R\".</li></ul></li><li>Turn the knob the way the arrow says to move the <strong>bullet</strong> (UP, R) <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Scope in MRAD (milliradian)? Then 0.1 MRAD per click is 1 cm at 100 m <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 400\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">.308, 150 gr, 100 yd zero</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">APPROXIMATE. Drop exaggerated to show shape</text>\n\n  <!-- line of sight -->\n  <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 5\"/>\n  <text x=\"44\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Line of sight (crosshair)</text>\n  <!-- rifle -->\n  <rect x=\"14\" y=\"156\" width=\"36\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <rect x=\"18\" y=\"143\" width=\"26\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#23261f\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <!-- bullet path -->\n  <path d=\"M50,161 C90,148 120,147 157,150 C200,153 240,168 263,180 C300,200 340,232 370,261\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n  <text x=\"300\" y=\"196\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#e8590c\" font-weight=\"bold\">Bullet path</text>\n\n  <!-- zero point -->\n  <circle cx=\"157\" cy=\"150\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"157\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Zero</text>\n  <text x=\"157\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">91 m (100 yd)</text>\n\n  <!-- 200 yd -->\n  <line x1=\"263\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"263\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"263\" cy=\"180\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#23261f\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"232\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\">183 m (200 yd):</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" font-weight=\"bold\">about 10 cm low</text>\n  <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"218\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"186\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n\n  <!-- 300 yd -->\n  <line x1=\"370\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"261\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"261\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#23261f\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"385\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"end\">274 m (300 yd):</text>\n  <text x=\"385\" y=\"308\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\">about 37 cm low</text>\n\n  <!-- footnote -->\n  <rect x=\"10\" y=\"326\" width=\"380\" height=\"66\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" fill-opacity=\"0.25\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"346\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\">Source: Federal Power Shok 150 gr, 2,820 fps,</text>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"364\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\">factory test barrel. Your 20 in barrel is slower:</text>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"382\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\">expect more drop. Confirm on paper.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Zero at <strong>100 m</strong> this season. Then see the real drop at 200 m (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: 100 m, 200 m or MPBR</summary><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Zero</th><th>Pros</th><th>Cons</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>100 m</td><td>Easy to set and check at any range. Dead on at typical deer distance</td><td>Bullet drops more past 200 m</td></tr><tr><td>200 m</td><td>Flatter to about 250 m. About 4.6 cm high at 100 yd <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td><td>Harder to check. Need a 200 m range</td></tr><tr><td>MPBR (maximum point blank range)</td><td>Hold centre, hit a 15 cm (6 in) vital zone out to the longest distance possible <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span></td><td>Needs a ballistic calculator. Bullet is high at middle ranges</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>MPBR picks the zero so the bullet never rises or falls more than half the vital zone <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Your 20 inch barrel shoots slower than factory test barrels. Expect more drop than the box says (Tip).</li></ul></details><aside class=\"callout lean\"><div class=\"callout-t\">My lean (opinion)</div><p><strong>Zero at 100 m</strong> this season. Shoot one group at 200 m to see the real drop. Your limit: the distance where you hit a paper plate from sitting (Tip).</p></aside>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Club</th><th>Town</th><th>Good for</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Kamloops Target Sports Association</td><td>Kamloops</td><td>Rifle, members only <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Kamloops and District Fish and Game</td><td>Kamloops</td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> range and guests <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Heffley Creek Gun Club</td><td>Kamloops area</td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> range <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">60%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Kamloops Shotgun Sports</td><td>Kamloops</td><td>Trap, skeet, sporting clays <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td></tr><tr><td>Mission and District Rod and Gun Club</td><td>Mission</td><td>Rifle 25 to 200 m, shotgun (65 to 70%)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: range details</summary><ul><li><strong>Kamloops:</strong> Kamloops Target Sports Association. Members only. Short range up to 50 m, long range for all rifles <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Kamloops and District Fish and Game Association: club confirmed. Range details and guest rules: <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Heffley Creek Gun Club: club confirmed. Range details: <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">60%</span>.</li><li>Kamloops Shotgun Sports: trap, skeet and sporting clays. Good for shotgun practice <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li><strong>Mission:</strong> Mission and District Rod and Gun Club. Private, members and guests. PAL (Possession and Acquisition Licence) shown at sign up <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.<ul><li>Rifle boards at 25, 50, 100 and 200 m. Shotgun range too <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li></ul></li><li>Hours and guest fees change. Check each club site before you drive: <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span>.</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"steps\" data-n=\"3\"><div class=\"steps-head\"><b>Pattern in 3 steps</b><span class=\"steps-count\">1 of 3</span></div><div class=\"steps-track\"><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Patterning step 1: hang paper about 1 metre square with an aim dot in the middle. Measure 37 metres, which is 40 yards, back to your rest.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Paper, dot, 37 m</text>\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"230\" width=\"400\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\"/>\n  <rect x=\"270\" y=\"70\" width=\"110\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"325\" cy=\"125\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <rect x=\"280\" y=\"180\" width=\"6\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><rect x=\"364\" y=\"180\" width=\"6\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/>\n  <text x=\"325\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">about 1 m square</text>\n  <rect x=\"20\" y=\"196\" width=\"60\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Rest</text>\n  <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"212\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"212\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 5\"/>\n  <text x=\"175\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">37 m (40 yd)</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1 shell per sheet. 3 sheets per load and choke (Tip)</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>1.</b> Paper, aim dot, pace off 37 m (40 yd).</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 460\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"460\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pattern check at 37 m (40 yd)</text>\n  <!-- paper -->\n  <rect x=\"40\" y=\"44\" width=\"320\" height=\"320\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <!-- 76 cm circle -->\n  <circle cx=\"206\" cy=\"198\" r=\"120\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" fill-opacity=\"0.15\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 6\"/>\n  <!-- aim dot -->\n  <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"204\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <!-- pellets -->\n  <g fill=\"#23261f\">\n    <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"150\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"130\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"120\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"140\" r=\"3\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"170\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"210\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"250\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"270\" r=\"3\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"260\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"240\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"135\" cy=\"200\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"190\" r=\"3\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"170\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"190\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"225\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"185\" cy=\"225\" r=\"3\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"165\" cy=\"165\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"245\" cy=\"215\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"195\" cy=\"145\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"225\" cy=\"160\" r=\"3\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"215\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"190\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"205\" cy=\"245\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"170\" r=\"3\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"150\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"250\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"270\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"110\" r=\"3\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"200\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"300\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"330\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"90\" r=\"3\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"300\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"275\" cy=\"100\" r=\"3\"/>\n  </g>\n  <!-- gap -->\n  <circle cx=\"235\" cy=\"295\" r=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"256\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#e8590c\" font-weight=\"bold\">gap?</text>\n  <!-- labels -->\n  <text x=\"48\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\">Paper about 1 m square</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"384\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Dashed ring: 76 cm (30 in) circle</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"404\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Orange dot: where you aimed</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"428\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">% = holes in ring ÷ pellets in shell × 100</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"450\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Schematic. Not a real pattern.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>2.</b> Circle the densest part. Count holes inside.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Pattern math. 82 holes in the circle divided by 138 pellets in the shell is about 59 percent, which acts like Modified. Benchmarks: Cylinder 40 percent, Improved Cylinder 50, Modified 60, Full 70.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Read your pattern</text>\n  <g font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <rect x=\"14\" y=\"40\" width=\"100\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"64\" y=\"62\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">82 holes</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">in circle</text>\n    <text x=\"128\" y=\"72\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">÷</text>\n    <rect x=\"142\" y=\"40\" width=\"110\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"197\" y=\"62\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">138 pellets</text><text x=\"197\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">in shell</text>\n    <text x=\"266\" y=\"72\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">=</text>\n    <rect x=\"280\" y=\"40\" width=\"106\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"333\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\">59%</text>\n  </g>\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"270\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <rect x=\"76\" y=\"190\" width=\"56\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"104\" y=\"184\">40%</text><text x=\"104\" y=\"290\">Cyl</text>\n    <rect x=\"148\" y=\"170\" width=\"56\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"176\" y=\"164\">50%</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"290\">IC</text>\n    <rect x=\"220\" y=\"150\" width=\"56\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><text x=\"248\" y=\"144\">60%</text><text x=\"248\" y=\"290\">M</text>\n    <rect x=\"292\" y=\"130\" width=\"56\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"124\">70%</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"290\">Full</text>\n  </g>\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"152\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n  <text x=\"62\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\">Yours: 59%</text>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Benchmarks at 37 m: your gun acts like Modified</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>3.</b> Holes ÷ pellets in the shell = your percent.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"steps-nav\"><button class=\"steps-prev\" aria-label=\"Back\">‹ Back</button><span class=\"steps-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><button class=\"steps-next\" aria-label=\"Next\">Next ›</button></div></div><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the full steps</summary><ul><li>Hang paper about 1 m square. Mark an aim dot in the middle (Tip).</li><li>Pace or measure <strong>37 m (40 yd)</strong>. Shoot from a rest at the dot <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>One shell per sheet. Shoot 3 sheets with your duck load and choke (Tip).</li><li>Draw a <strong>76 cm (30 in)</strong> circle around the <strong>densest part</strong> of the pattern <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Count the pellet holes inside the circle.</li><li>Percent = holes in circle ÷ pellets in the shell × 100 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Pattern math. 82 holes in the circle divided by 138 pellets in the shell is about 59 percent, which acts like Modified. Benchmarks: Cylinder 40 percent, Improved Cylinder 50, Modified 60, Full 70.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Read your pattern</text>\n  <g font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <rect x=\"14\" y=\"40\" width=\"100\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"64\" y=\"62\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">82 holes</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">in circle</text>\n    <text x=\"128\" y=\"72\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">÷</text>\n    <rect x=\"142\" y=\"40\" width=\"110\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"197\" y=\"62\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">138 pellets</text><text x=\"197\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">in shell</text>\n    <text x=\"266\" y=\"72\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">=</text>\n    <rect x=\"280\" y=\"40\" width=\"106\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"333\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\">59%</text>\n  </g>\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"270\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <rect x=\"76\" y=\"190\" width=\"56\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"104\" y=\"184\">40%</text><text x=\"104\" y=\"290\">Cyl</text>\n    <rect x=\"148\" y=\"170\" width=\"56\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"176\" y=\"164\">50%</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"290\">IC</text>\n    <rect x=\"220\" y=\"150\" width=\"56\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><text x=\"248\" y=\"144\">60%</text><text x=\"248\" y=\"290\">M</text>\n    <rect x=\"292\" y=\"130\" width=\"56\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"124\">70%</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"290\">Full</text>\n  </g>\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"152\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/>\n  <text x=\"62\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\">Yours: 59%</text>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Benchmarks at 37 m: your gun acts like Modified</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Look for <strong>gaps</strong> a duck could slip through. Gaps matter more than percent (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: pellet counts and benchmarks</summary><ul><li>#2 steel has about 120 to 124 pellets per ounce. A 1 1/8 oz shell holds about 136 to 140 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Example: 82 holes in the circle ÷ 138 pellets = about <strong>59%</strong>. That acts like Modified <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Benchmarks: Cylinder 40%, IC (Improved Cylinder) 50%, M (Modified) 60%, Full 70% <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Is the pattern centred on the dot? If not, the gun shoots high, low or to a side. Know it (Tip).</li><li>Look for <strong>holes</strong> big enough for a duck to slip through. Gaps matter more than the percent (Tip).</li><li>Try IC and M with 2 loads. Keep the combo with the even, centred pattern (Tip).</li></ul></details><aside class=\"callout rule\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Three shots tell the truth. One shot tells a story. Never move the scope for a single hole.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Zeroing with cheap ammo, hunting with another bullet.</li><li>Adjusting after every shot.</li><li>Never patterning the shotgun.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Write zero, load and 200 m drop on tape inside the scope cap. Check with 1 shot before each trip.</p></aside>","<ul><li>Ranges, loads and patterning: club sites and secondary sources (65 to 70%). MOA math worked out by Hunt Mentor <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: all sources</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.letsgoshooting.org/resources/articles/rifle/bore-sighting-basics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Let's Go Shooting: bore sighting basics</a>, checked 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.federalpremium.com/rifle/power-shok/11-308A.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Federal Power Shok .308 150 gr product page</a>, 2,820 fps, 100 yd zero drops, checked 2026-10-01 (65%, search preview)</li><li><a href=\"https://ammosight.com/calculators/trajectory/zero/308-100-yard-vs-200-yard-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ammosight .308 100 vs 200 yard zero</a>, 200 yd zero numbers, checked 2026-10-01 (65%, search preview)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.americanhunter.org/content/how-to-zero-your-rifle-for-maximum-point-blank-range/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">American Hunter: zero for maximum point blank range</a>, checked 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.silvercore.ca/blog/gun-ranges-in-british-columbia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Silvercore: shooting ranges in BC</a>, checked 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://ktsa.ca/range-info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kamloops Target Sports Association range info</a>, checked 2026-10-01 (70%, search preview)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.kdfga.ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kamloops and District Fish and Game Association</a>, checked 2026-10-01 (65%, search preview)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.kamloopsshotgunsports.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kamloops Shotgun Sports</a>, checked 2026-10-01 (65%, search preview)</li><li><a href=\"https://missionrodandgun.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mission and District Rod and Gun Club</a>, checked 2026-10-01 (70%, search preview)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.nrafamily.org/content/how-to-pattern-a-shotgun/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NRA Family: how to pattern a shotgun</a>, checked 2026-10-01 (70%, search preview)</li><li><a href=\"https://kentcartridge.com/kent-community-blog/why-pellet-count-matters/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kent Cartridge: why pellet count matters</a>, steel pellet counts, checked 2026-10-01 (65%, search preview)</li><li>MOA math: 1 MOA = 1/60 degree, worked out by Hunt Mentor <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li></ul></details>"]